---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Sponsor | Macro Evidence"
  description="Help sustain Macro Evidence's open macroeconomic data infrastructure and the ongoing engineering behind Macro Data Observatory."
>
  <PageIntro
    kicker="Sponsor"
    title="Help sustain open infrastructure."
    lead="Sponsorship helps sustain the shared infrastructure and ongoing engineering required to keep Macro Evidence's public work open, reproducible, documented, and maintainable."
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="site-container split">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">What support sustains</span>
        <h2>Infrastructure, quality, maintenance, and documentation.</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>Sponsorship can help fund:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>infrastructure, hosting, and CI/CD;</li>
          <li>automated validation and data-quality work;</li>
          <li>maintenance and documentation;</li>
          <li>continued evidence-led development of Macro Data Observatory.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section records-section">
    <div class="site-container split">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Independence</span>
        <h2>Support strengthens the work without buying control.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="reading">
        <p>
          Recognition may scale with sponsorship, but sponsorship does not purchase technical governance, roadmap
          control, preferential feature acceptance, issue priority, private technical influence, or service-level
          commitments.
        </p>
        <p>
          Support does not change how technical or organizational decisions are made. We continue to follow the same
          documented process and the needs of the work.
        </p>
        <p><strong>Current availability:</strong> Sponsorship is not yet available through GitHub Sponsors.</p>
        <p>
          Questions about institutional sponsorship or billing? Email{' '}
          <a href="mailto:billing@macro-evidence.com">billing@macro-evidence.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
